  "about": "Caption fonts bundled with Clips Kitty (video/fonts.py). Each is an unmodified static TTF from github.com/google/fonts (ofl/) at one pinned commit, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, with its OFL.txt beside it. family is the name libass matches (the TTF name table's family name, ID 1). scripts lists only the writing systems whose every letter is in the file's character map (video/alphabets.py SCRIPT_LETTERS); tests/test_caption_fonts.py reads each file's character map and checks the list is exactly that. Whether a clip keeps a bundled font goes by the letters of its language (video/captions.py caption_font_for), not by this list.",
